    "text": "Hydroxyapatite <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>Ca</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>Ca</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>OH</mi><msub><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Hydroxyapatite in presence of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math>ions converts to fluorapatite <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>Ca</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>PO</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#183;</mo><msub><mi>CaF</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>.",
